config QCOM_SAMURAI_EUD_HANDOFF
	bool "RMX1931 structured EUD firmware handoff evidence"
	depends on ARM64 && ARCH_QCOM && EFI && OF
	default n
	help
	  Receive the reserved-page record from the paired samurai firmware
	  through its real EFI configuration table. No MMIO, route change or
	  permission is created by receiving this evidence. A separate actual
	  resource-owning, revocable route supplier remains required.
